{title: Siyahamba}
{artist: South African traditional}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 108}

Verse 1
[D]Siyahamb' ekukhanyeni kwen[G]khos',
[D]siyahamb' ekukha[A]nyeni kwen[D]khos'.
Siyahamb' ekukhanyeni kwen[G]khos',
[D]siyahamb' ekukha[A]nyeni kwen[D]khos'.

Chorus
[D]Siyahamba, hamba, siyaham[G]ba, hamba,
[D]siyahamb' ekukha[A]nyeni kwen[D]khos'.
Siyahamba, hamba, siyaham[G]ba, hamba,
[D]siyahamb' ekukha[A]nyeni kwen[D]khos'.

Verse 2
[D]We are marching in the light of [G]God,
[D]we are marching in the [A]light of [D]God.
We are marching in the light of [G]God,
[D]we are marching in the [A]light of [D]God.
